    <briefdescription>
<para>Bluetooth A2DP Sub-Band Codec (SBC) Decoder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Zero-heap, fixed-point integer implementation of the Bluetooth SIG SBC decoder (A2DP spec v1.3 / Bluetooth Core Spec AVTP). Supports 4 and 8 subbands, 4, 8, 12, 16 blocks, Mono/Dual Channel/Stereo/Joint Stereo, Loudness and SNR bit allocation, and sample rates 16k, 32k, 44.1k, 48k. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
